:"Liftr ni našel nobene vaje. Uporabi vrstice, kot je „Leg press 3x12 40 kg“.","Liftr export":"Izvoz iz Liftra","Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr nima računa, strežnika ali oglasov. Tvoji treningi, vaje, načrti, telesne mere in fitnes kartica so shranjeni v tvoji napravi in v tvojem zasebnem iCloudu.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr je narejen tako, da tvoj trening ostane zaseben.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr shranjuje treninge s trajanjem in kalorijami ter bere tvojo težo, sestavo telesa in srčni utrip v mirovanju. Dostop spremeniš v aplikaciji Zdravje → Profil → Aplikacije → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr pokaže tvoj zadnji trening, rekorde in kako napreduje tvoja moč.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr bo samodejno poskusil znova.","Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Liftr bo poskusil znova pozneje. Tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi.","Log weight":"Vnesi težo","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Beleži vaje, serije, ponovitve in težo v nekaj sekundah — brez zapiskov.","MIN":"MIN","Machine":"Naprava","Make a routine":"Ustvari načrt","Mark set done":"Označi serijo kot opravljeno","Max":"Maks","Min":"Min","Minimise":"Pomanjšaj","Morning workout":"Jutranji trening","Most reps":"Največ pon.","Muscle group":"Mišična skupina","My passes":"Moje kartice","My routines":"Moji načrti","Name":"Ime","Name of the gym":"Ime fitnesa","Name on the pass (optional)":"Ime na kartici (neobvezno)","Name, e.g. Monday: legs":"Ime, npr. Ponedeljek: noge","New":"Nov","New exercise":"Nova vaja","New records":"Novi rekordi","New routine":"Nov načrt","Next":"Naprej","Next exercise":"Naslednja vaja","No code found":"Koda ni najdena","No data in this period.":"V tem obdobju ni podatkov.","No data yet":"Še ni podatkov","No routines yet":"Še ni načrtov","No tracking":"Brez sledenja","No weight yet. Log it here or connect a smart scale to Apple Health.":"Teže še ni. Vnesi jo tukaj ali poveži pametno tehtnico z aplikacijo Zdravje.","No workout on this day.":"Ta dan ni bilo treninga.","No workouts this week yet — next week is a fresh start.":"Ta teden še brez treninga — naslednji teden je nov začetek.","No workouts yet":"Še ni treningov","Not connected":"Ni povezano","Not done yet.":"Še ni opravljeno.","Not now":"Ne zdaj","Note":"Opomba","Note (optional)":"Opomba (neobvezno)","Notes":"Opombe","Notifications":"Obvestila","Notifications are off":"Obvestila so izklopljena","Now":"Zdaj","Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.":"Samo s tvojim dovoljenjem Liftr bere tvojo težo, telesno sestavo in srčni utrip v mirovanju ter shranjuje treninge, kalorije, razdaljo in težo. Zdravstveni podatki prek Liftr nikoli ne zapustijo tvojih naprav in se nikoli ne uporabljajo za oglaševanje. Dostop lahko kadar koli spremeniš v aplikaciji Zdravje.","Open Settings":"Odpri Nastavitve","Paste":"Prilepi","Pause":"Premor","Point the camera at the code on your pass":"Usmeri kamero v kodo na svoji kartici","Pounds (lb)":"Funti (lb)","Privacy":"Zasebnost","Progress":"Napredek","Questions?":"Vprašanja?","REPS":"PON.","REST":"POČITEK","Ready to train?":"Gremo trenirat?","Records":"Rekordi","Reminders":"Opomniki","Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.":"Opomniki in časovnik počitka se načrtujejo v tvoji napravi. Strežnika za potisna obves