ses as you go.":"Začni prazen trening in sproti dodajaj vaje.","Start rest timer after each set":"Zaženi časovnik počitka po vsaki seriji","Start workout":"Začni trening","Sync problem":"Težava pri sinhronizaciji","Synced with iCloud":"Sinhronizirano z iCloudom","Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.":"Sinhronizacija med tvojim iPhonom, iPadom in Apple Watch poteka prek tvoje zasebne zbirke podatkov iCloud. Razvijalec teh podatkov ne vidi. Koda tvoje fitnes kartice je šifrirana od konca do konca.","Syncing…":"Sinhroniziranje…","TIME":"ČAS","Tap for technical details":"Tapni za tehnične podrobnosti","Tap the card to show the code":"Tapni kartico, da pokažeš kodo","Tap the card to turn it over":"Tapni kartico, da jo obrneš","Technical details":"Tehnične podrobnosti","The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.":"Kamera in tvoje fotografije se uporabljajo samo za branje kode tvoje fitnes kartice. Slike se ne shranjujejo in se nikamor ne pošiljajo.","This code can't be drawn":"Te kode ni mogoče izrisati","This month":"Ta mesec","This version of Liftr can't save to iCloud yet. Your workouts are safe on this device and sync once this is fixed.":"Ta različica Liftra še ne more shranjevati v iCloud. Tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi in se bodo sinhronizirali, ko bo to odpravljeno.","This week":"Ta teden","This week: 1 workout, {1} lifted. Great job!":"Ta teden: 1 trening, dvignjeno {1}. Odlično!","This week: {1} workouts, {2} lifted. Great job!":"Treningi ta teden: {1}, dvignjeno {2}. Odlično!","Time":"Ura","Time for your next set 💪":"Čas za naslednjo serijo 💪","Time to train 💪":"Čas za trening 💪","Time trained":"Čas treninga","To failure":"Do odpovedi","Today":"Danes","Total volume per workout (weight × reps)":"Skupni volumen na trening (teža × ponovitve)","Tr